Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.26,0:00:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.19,0:00:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要参加决斗嘉年华？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.44,0:00:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（高修）是的，请您务必批准。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已经厌倦了只能在一旁看着。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.53,0:00:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）哦……看来你的斗志
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.71,0:00:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被点燃了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.91,0:00:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就没办法了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}非常感谢您。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，高修……既然要出场，就得给我赢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.89,0:00:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你明白吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.49,0:00:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会打进决赛，然后那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德罗瓦）目标是九十九游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.67,0:00:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但他拥有 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.58,0:00:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且还是原版。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.61,0:00:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你有什么秘策吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.67,0:00:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西，没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.59,0:01:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用这家伙来战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.96,0:01:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Mr.心园给的卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.73,0:01:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要封印起来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.93,0:01:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，不是借来的东西用我自己的卡组来战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.85,0:01:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这家伙把 No.的原始体
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.92,0:01:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒之后，才能把那家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.64,0:01:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才能胜过快斗那小子。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.45,0:01:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈什……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.45,0:01:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德罗瓦……你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决赛快斗也一定会打上来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.78,0:01:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要进决赛，今天一天就得
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.77,0:01:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各自拿到5个心之碎片……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.42,0:01:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈什）能做到的，只要是我和你。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.65,0:01:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德罗瓦）啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.19,0:01:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）搞什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.07,0:01:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}六十郎爷爷……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.70,0:01:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然趁我睡觉的时候回去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（春）什么！我可是一直很放心哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.31,0:01:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（春）游马已经好好地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.36,0:01:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开始走上自己该走的路了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.05,0:02:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我该走的路……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.47,0:02:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）是决斗世界冠军吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.57,0:02:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然都走到这一步了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.38,0:02:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就坚持到最后吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.10,0:02:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.58,0:02:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！决斗饭 决斗饭。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.06,0:02:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～！这个 这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.85,0:02:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢啦 小步。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.69,0:02:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要加油啊 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.13,0:02:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}菜鸟 加油菜鸟 加油。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不是菜鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 我出门了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.19,0:02:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）早上好 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.59,0:02:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！铁男！大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.07,0:02:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哟！怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！委员长 已经没事了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.59,0:02:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.64,0:02:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然还没到完全复活的程度。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.85,0:02:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）总而言之
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.12,0:02:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Numbers Club 全员 到齐……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）来给游马加油的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～！ 你们这些家伙……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 该有的还是伙伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.86,0:03:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）游马 看起来挺精神的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.23,0:03:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}展开激烈战斗的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.75,0:03:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华预选也 到了最后一天！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.36,0:03:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}集齐５个心之碎片来到决赛的勇者会是谁！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都走到这一步了 请以进入决赛……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.33,0:03:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 请以夺冠为目标。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那当然！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管决赛 有多少强得离谱的家伙聚集过来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.59,0:03:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我都 一定会 赢……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）喂… 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.94,0:03:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爷爷说过，我啊，正在寻找
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.93,0:03:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}属于自己的道路……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.92,0:03:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）我也一直在思考。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.19,0:03:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，找不到。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.11,0:03:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗、拯救春人，还有鲨鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以及拯救你父亲的道路……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也是啊，星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.08,0:03:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊，不想失去任何一个人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.19,0:04:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……不……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个……总之，我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.81,0:04:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.72,0:04:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要去寻找让大家都能变得最幸福的那条路！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.80,0:04:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让大家都能幸福的道路……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.11,0:04:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊，只要游马成为决斗冠军就幸福了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，我也脸上有光啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要进决赛 需要心之碎片 乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.62,0:04:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凑齐几个了乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.81,0:04:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！我的心之碎片已经凑齐4个了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～嘞 为了游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.59,0:04:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总而言之！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.65,0:04:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家分头去找剩下的决斗者对吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以的话 找看起来弱的家伙 乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.35,0:04:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看起来弱的人喵…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算这样也要找 找弱的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.45,0:04:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）弱的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的家伙… 剩下的家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.64,0:06:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃～… 看起来弱的决斗者…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.56,0:06:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看起来弱的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找到了的话 告诉我。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}尽量找看起来弱的决斗者拜托了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}弱的决斗者… 那种家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.73,0:06:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定躲在这种后巷里乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）啊… 啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.90,0:07:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个可怕的运营委员长！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.84,0:07:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这… 这边也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.97,0:07:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个个全都是没什么嚼头的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 这样一来彼此凑齐的心之碎片就有3个了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.67,0:07:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这两个人…》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.78,0:07:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（罗宾）我是 异次元超能力者·星星·罗宾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}惊奇拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.54,0:08:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.28,0:08:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 胜利的大放送！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀！ 请给我签名！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们签名能不能之后再说啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（高修）喂 让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 看起来还挺有嚼头的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也看来你是决斗嘉年华的参赛者呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.43,0:08:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，从今天开始的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.85,0:08:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.47,0:08:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}之前的两天{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.60,0:08:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我因为拍摄一直没法离开摄影棚。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望你拿到第四个心之碎片我祈祷着。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.86,0:08:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.93,0:08:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这句话，原样奉还给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别大意了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.91,0:08:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}短时间内就拿到3个心之碎片……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以才有意思嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.99,0:08:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连罗宾都冒出来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.17,0:09:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，一决胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.29,0:09:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.28,0:09:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.25,0:09:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像，连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.49,0:09:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟 幸。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.97,0:09:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然来了啊。来给罗宾大人加油。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（幸）啊 罗宾大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾！那家伙也居然参加了大会……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.06,0:09:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把这家伙以守备表示特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.72,0:09:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 铁巨人铁锤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦～！好厉害！！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.86,0:09:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾的场地上英雄们齐聚一堂。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.68,0:10:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异次元超能者·星·罗宾与他的伙伴们。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.84,0:10:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每一个都是很棒的怪兽……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一想起那场激战就热血沸腾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.02,0:10:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.94,0:10:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 罗宾的对手是强敌乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.31,0:10:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 对手是那个戈什。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.53,0:10:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 为什么那家伙会和罗宾？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.72,0:10:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）看来他辞掉了运营委员
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:32.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后参加大会了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.86,0:10:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.34,0:10:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看着我的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.09,0:10:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙也参加了大会……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说回来 戈修的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.73,0:10:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和跟我战斗的时候不一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.01,0:10:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是为了配合WDC换了卡组吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 以现在的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.42,0:10:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本敌不过罗宾的那些英雄。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.93,0:10:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！星之罗宾。攻击斯巴达斯！！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.91,0:11:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 让你见识见识。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的英雄挑战者 斯巴达斯的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.88,0:11:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}英雄阵型！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.18,0:11:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙在对方怪兽攻击时
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.68,0:11:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以组成阵形将攻击力合在一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.31,0:11:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！这样下去罗宾就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.65,0:11:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，罗宾的攻击并没有被封住。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有一套。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 发动！喷气钢铁号！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.69,0:11:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以通过
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.26,0:11:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放场上的罗宾家族
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.49,0:11:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来特殊召唤异次元喷气钢铁号。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且它的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.58,0:11:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等于解放的怪兽攻击力总和。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.36,0:11:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（罗宾）来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.37,0:11:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异次元喷气钢铁号！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.95,0:11:50.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 ８０００！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.71,0:11:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！异次元喷气钢铁号！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.57,0:11:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}钢铁不死鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.19,0:11:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！英雄守卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放１只斯巴达斯，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.81,0:12:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}减轻其攻击力数值的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼……我还有１张陷阱卡 打开！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续陷阱 英雄复仇之剑。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.43,0:12:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在 英雄挑战者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被干掉的时候可以发动
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了这张卡的怪兽进行战斗时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.09,0:12:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将破坏了英雄挑战者的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.09,0:12:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并给那个玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成那个怪兽攻击力数值的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.21,0:12:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 罗宾要受到 ８０００的伤害！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就逆转了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.85,0:12:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没那么容易。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.54,0:12:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 异次元喷气铁号 的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.75,0:12:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.17,0:12:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.44,0:12:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤墓地里的４只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:12:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来这招啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.73,0:13:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 英雄复仇之剑的效果也
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此为止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.73,0:13:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}瞬间就做出反应，挺上道嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.80,0:13:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彼此彼此。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.77,0:13:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来我似乎遇上了个好对手啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于特殊召唤了盖鲁达
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.55,0:13:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我抽1张卡，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.03,0:13:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害…好厉害啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.85,0:13:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈什的热血战斗还有罗宾的华丽决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两边都好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.18,0:13:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊…我也想打决斗啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的那一个斯巴达斯正诉说着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.59,0:13:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要为同伴报仇呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.45,0:13:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将斯巴达斯解放，进行升级召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！英雄挑战者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.85,0:13:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战锤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.31,0:13:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！攻击野兽战士美洲狮！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，罗宾他！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.31,0:14:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}美洲狮。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.58,0:14:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}美洲狮被破坏了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.67,0:14:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这炽热的灵魂，我就收下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.22,0:14:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动战锤的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将在战斗中被破坏的怪兽作为装备卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.69,0:14:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加到战锤的攻击力上。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.90,0:14:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害，这就是戈修真正的力量吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天的他确实不一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.77,0:14:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔，同伴的力量竟然被夺走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，我盖一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭现在罗宾场上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.31,0:14:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本敌不过戈修的战锤。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.20,0:14:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，你看啊，那张脸。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾还没有放弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.60,0:15:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《无论被逼到何种境地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.04,0:15:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都绝不放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}继续相信自己。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.76,0:15:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是游马教给我的，一飞冲天》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.91,0:15:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.79,0:15:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.77,0:15:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河女王之光！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.10,0:15:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以选择
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.03,0:15:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.93,0:15:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其他所有怪兽的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.95,0:15:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到结束阶段为止变成与选择的怪兽相同。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择等级10的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.39,0:15:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异次元超能人·星斗罗宾。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.61,0:15:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河之母啊，请赐予我的英雄们力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级10的罗宾家族进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.12,0:15:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.40,0:15:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.57,0:15:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，超次元机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.72,0:16:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河破坏者！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力5000！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.90,0:16:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太厉害了，罗宾。不，风也。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.17,0:16:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的决斗也和以前不一样了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.36,0:16:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实，也许是斩断了母亲的咒缚吧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.49,0:16:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连规模感都截然不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.36,0:16:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈什）有意思，这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.44,0:16:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就越来越来劲了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，你宣言攻击的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.03,0:16:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那一瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.19,0:16:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是你怪兽的最后一刻。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.66,0:16:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《戈什盖下的恐怕是N陷阱卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.45,0:16:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反应装甲。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.09,0:16:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其效果是当对方怪兽发动攻击的瞬间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.26,0:16:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论什么怪兽都能将其破坏的陷阱》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼。银河毁灭者的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.13,0:16:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.93,0:16:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.24,0:16:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方场上存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.81,0:16:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法·陷阱卡全部破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:16:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.22,0:17:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战锤的攻击力回到了２１００。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.04,0:17:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧　超次元机器人　银河破坏者！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.85,0:17:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击战锤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次攻击要是打中了，戈修就完蛋了呜啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.89,0:17:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.70,0:17:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把英雄挑战者　剑盾{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在战斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.27,0:17:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到２０００点以上伤害的时候…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.75,0:17:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效战斗伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.23,0:17:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把自己的生命值变成１００。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.61,0:17:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害　又撑住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.03,0:17:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然把那种卡藏在手牌里。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这就回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈修的生命值是１００。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:17:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾赢定了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.90,0:18:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了！　罗宾大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.25,0:18:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合　抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.15,0:18:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《好！》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.01,0:18:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 英雄挑战者
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.99,0:18:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.63,0:18:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽1只可以当作2只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.43,0:18:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.39,0:18:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.46,0:18:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 等级4的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.16,0:18:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双枪2只份量进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.56,0:18:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.08,0:18:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.02,0:18:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 英雄冠军 圣剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.05,0:18:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从那个状态进行超量召唤……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 这家伙在我的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.57,0:19:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降到500以下之前 是没法攻击的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.27,0:19:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.88,0:19:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动圣剑的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用叠放单位让攻击力变成2倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.72,0:19:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变成4000！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.52,0:19:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 罗宾的怪兽有5000！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算翻倍也还是不够。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.23,0:19:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.14,0:19:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}英雄机会！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.19,0:19:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把Excalibur的攻击力再翻一倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.16,0:19:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力8000！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他一直在等这个机会吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.27,0:19:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！Excalibur！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.34,0:19:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击银河破坏者！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.35,0:19:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一刀两断！必杀真剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.17,0:19:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.57,0:20:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾他……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.03,0:20:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}输掉了啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.87,0:20:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是输了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.76,0:20:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.62,0:20:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我很开心哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.53,0:20:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！我看着就明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.19,0:20:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在和你的战斗中被教会了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.85,0:20:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗是要开心地去进行的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.74,0:20:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.33,0:20:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是一场好决斗。　我向你道谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.04,0:20:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该说谢谢的是我能和你战斗我很开心。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.06,0:20:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你辞掉了运营委员是真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.02,0:21:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。　为了和你战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.42,0:21:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.20,0:21:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定要打进决赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.83,0:21:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我等着你。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.01,0:21:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他或许也是被你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.66,0:21:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}教会了决斗的乐趣。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.68,0:21:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.85,0:21:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真不可思议。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.42,0:21:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和游马决斗过的人大家都会露出笑容。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.59,0:21:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）风也君！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.38,0:21:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你拥有那样的才能。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用决斗让人幸福的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.63,0:21:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用决斗让人幸福？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.15,0:21:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今后也希望你让更多的人幸福。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.68,0:21:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为此你一定要一直赢下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.59,0:21:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀——罗宾大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用决斗让大家都幸福？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.20,0:21:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.78,0:21:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然，这样就好！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.09,0:21:56.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢了，罗宾。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.65,0:22:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我今后也要{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.82,0:22:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的路已经定了。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.17,0:22:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，我也……。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.52,0:24:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次要介绍的是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.62,0:24:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高什的王牌怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.13,0:24:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}英雄冠军 王者之剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.52,0:24:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过效果可以让攻击力变成２倍{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.25,0:24:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是一只配得上冠军之名的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.58,0:24:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是快吃快拉的冠军啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.14,0:24:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个就不用了。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.00,0:24:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得也是。

